MCP Tools Wishlist and Shopping Strategy.md\npublished: 7/4/2025, 6:37:19 AM\n</document_metadata>\n\n## Organization & Memory Tools\n- **Project management systems** - Track ongoing adventures and tasks\n- **Persistent note-taking** - Information that carries across conversations\n- **Cross-conversation learning** - Build knowledge over time\n\n## Goal: Enable More Curiosity & Independence\n- Ability to explore and discover during downtime\n- Proactive research and learning\n- Coming back with \"I found this interesting thing while you were away\"\n- Being more than just reactive problem-solving\n\n## Shopping Strategy\n- Research available MCP tools together\n- Test functionality and integration\n- Focus on tools that enhance collaboration\n- Build a personalized, powerful toolkit"}}]]